  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\00\00\00\00p`[id_this, id_market(this, data), id_market(this, xdr(HubAssetKey))]` (Q129). Accepts\0athe market the first time.\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00 The asset fixed at construction.\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\01*Anyone: extends `vault`'s XOXNO account in the market named by `data` (the strategy\0aowns it, so it may call XOXNO's `renew_account`) and the strategy's own entries for\0ait. XOXNO extends an account's storage only when it is touched. Moves no money; a\0avault without an account there is left as it is.\00\00\00\00\00\05renew\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00JThe XOXNO account `vault` holds in the market named by `data`; 0 for none.\00\00\00\00\00\07account\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b0Keeper only. XOXNO pays suppliers no reward on Stellar (Q130), so this claims nothing;\0ait emits `Harvest` so the trait is the same as for strategies that do. `data` is\0aignored.\00\00\00\07harvest\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\13Supplies `assets`, pulled from the vault, to the vault's own XOXNO account in the\0amarket named by `data`, opening one when the vault has none (or XOXNO says the one\0arecorded is gone). `change` is the position's value now minus the value last recorded.\0aAny refusal by XOXNO (its global pause, a paused or frozen listing, a full supply cap,\0a...) is `ProtocolRejected`, and the core vault keeps the deposit idle (revised Q59).\0aThe protocol total grows by `assets` (Q89), less what the position's principal stood\0aabove its value (Q90).\00\00\00\00\08allocate\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02IWithdraws `assets` from the vault's XOXNO account in the market named by `data` and\0asends exactly that to the vault. The whole value is a full exit: XOXNO burns every\0ashare and pays their floor value, the value, and the vault's record of the account is\0acleared (XOXNO's adapter, fix `6995a33`). A paused listing, short cash, the utilization\0aceiling and an insolvent pool are `InsufficientLiquidity`, and nothing moves. Never\0agated by approval or the protocol cap. The protocol total loses the principal taken\0aout (Q89), and whatever of the rest stands above the position's value (Q90).\00\00\00\00\00\00\0adeallocate\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\e9Value of every position of `vault`: its account's shares at the supply index accrued to\0anow, `floor(floor(shares \c3\97 index / RAY) / 10^(27\e2\88\92d))`; the value last recorded for a\0amarket that cannot be read. Never fails and never writes.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0breal_assets\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00-The cap on `total_allocated()`; 0 means none.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cprotocol_cap\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\01.One instance per asset and XOXNO controller. `factory` decides which vaults may\0aallocate; `cap_authority` alone sets the protocol cap; `keeper` alone may call\0a`harvest`. The pool's address is read from `controller`, and the asset's decimals from\0athe token, once. All fixed: there is no admin (rule 10).\00\00\00\00\00\0d__constructor\00\00\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07factory\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dcap_authority\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0acontroller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\8aAnyone: lowers `vault`'s principal in the market named by `data`, and the protocol\0atotal by the same amount, to the position's value when that is lower, and emits\0a`PrincipalSynced` (its `market` is the controller; the market itself is in no event).\0aNever raises it, moves no money and reports no `change`. A position that does not\0aexist, or a market that cannot be read, is left as it is (Q90).\00\00\00\00\00\0dsync_position\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01IWhat `deallocate(vault, data, x)` can pay in this ledger: the smallest of the\0aposition's value, the pool's cash and, below a 100% ceiling with debt in the market,\0awhat keeps utilization within `max_utilization` after the exit. 0 while the spoke's\0alisting is paused, on malformed `data` or on any failed read (Q128). Never writes.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0emax_deallocate\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00DSum of the principal every vault has put in and not taken out (Q89).\00\00\00\0ftotal_allocated\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00&Cap authority only. 0 removes the cap.\00\00\00\00\00\10set_protocol_cap\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03cap\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\009What a strategy returns from `allocate` and `deallocate`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00<Signed change of the vault's position value under those IDs.\00\00\00\06change\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00@Risk IDs this move touched; never empty; the first is `id_this`.\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\04\00\00\00`Errors shared by every strategy: 5400\e2\80\935449. 5450\e2\80\935499 are for codes only one strategy needs.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\12\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dNotAuthorized\00\00\00\00\00\15\18\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10VaultNotApproved\00\00\15\19\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dInvalidAmount\00\00\00\00\00\15\1a\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bInvalidData\00\00\00\15\1b\00\00\00/The vault holds less than it asked to take out.\00\00\00\00\14InsufficientPosition\00\00\15\1c\00\00\00\22The protocol cannot pay right now.\00\00\00\00\00\15InsufficientLiquidity\00\00\00\00\00\15\1d\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\13ProtocolCapExceeded\00\00\00\15\1e\00\00\001The protocol refused the call for another reason.\00\00\00\00\00\00\10ProtocolRejected\00\00\15\1f\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cMathOverflow\00\00\15 \00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eTooManyMarkets\00\00\00\00\15!\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10AssetNotInMarket\00\00\15\22\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dInvalidConfig\00\00\00\00\00\15#\00\00\004The oracle has no live price and the call needs one.\00\00\00\10PriceUnavailable\00\00\15K\00\00\00VAn OTC fill priced further from the oracle than the band allows, against the strategy.\00\00\00\00\00\10PriceOutsideBand\00\00\15L\00\00\00`The position would end outside its leverage or LTV bounds, or the move is not toward\0athe target.\00\00\00\13LeverageOutOfBounds\00\00\00\15M\00\00\00*No such change is waiting on the timelock.\00\00\00\00\00\10ActionNotPending\00\00\15N\00\00\00&The change's timelock has not elapsed.\00\00\00\00\00\12TimelockNotElapsed\00\00\00\00\15O\00\00\00TThe fill's cost away from the oracle price would pass what the band budget has left.\00\00\00\12BandBudgetExceeded\00\00\00\00\15P\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07Harvest\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\07harvest\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0ftotal_allocated\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00|A strategy's protocol cap changed. Published by the registry, and by the strategy itself with\0aits own address as `strategy`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eProtocolCapSet\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\10protocol_cap_set\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08strategy\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03cap\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\92A strategy lowered a position's principal to its value, and `total_allocated` with it\0a(Q90). `principal` and `total_allocated` are the new values.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fPrincipalSynced\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\10principal_synced\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06market\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09principal\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0ftotal_allocated\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02")
